'''Light's Hope Chapel''' is the [[Argent Dawn]]'s base of operations in the [[Eastern Plaguelands]]. Located in the far east of the region, it serves as quest hub for both [[Horde]] and [[Alliance]] heroes. [[Scourgestone|Scourgestones]] may be turned in here for reputation with the Dawn.

